# Allowlist: the image needs exactly the source and the lockfile pair. Everything
# else — data, probes, docs, infra, git history — stays out of the build context,
# so a new top-level file is excluded until deliberately added here.
*
!src
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
# The committed registration the demo surface folds replays under (the publishability
# step) and the price table the demo's planner prices a visitor's run with (the live-path
# commands step); each named by file, so nothing else under preregistration/ enters the
# context.
!preregistration/registration.json
!preregistration/prices.json

src/**/__pycache__
